  "_comment_card_w": "Card W warm-validation leg (docs/SPEC_slip_qc_followups.md sec.2; report docs/slip_qc_d5a_report_2026-07-22.md).  1 h = 121 epochs @ 30 s, ~35-50 s/ep on this all-freq/all-channel tier => ~70-100 min per arm.  RELEASE ONLY, renamed exe, name-scoped zombie pre-kill.  Identical to the 10-ep smoke twin apart from max_duration_s (and the arm knob noted below), so the smoke IS this run truncated.  ARM (ii): hardening ON + Iono-2 mechanism B armed (estimation.global_vtec_sh.rep_error_tau_s = 900 s, the exact per-LOS GM deviation carry).  Mechanism A (layer2_max_degree, the dual-layer SH backbone) is deliberately LEFT OFF: the D5-A cross-experiment asks whether the per-LOS deviation carry absorbs the tension the D5 gate re-taps on, and arming two mechanisms at once would confound that answer.  Set layer2_max_degree=4 / layer2_height_km=1300 to run the full Iono-2 card.",
